This target is excluded from the change-driven CI matrix
(.github/scripts/compute-build-matrix.sh) and builds only via manual dispatch:
ami-build-manual.yml with build_targets=agentic/ubuntu26-gpu (or "all").

Reason: the builder is a g6.xlarge GPU instance and the source AMI is the
newest agentic/ubuntu26 -PASSED image. A base rebuild does not rebuild this
image automatically; rebuild it deliberately after the base changes.
